  "summary": "MCP is quickly becoming the open standard for AI agents, and for good reason! It’s well designed and easy to use — however, MCP implementations are limited since: 1. The best models are large and closed-source (3.7 Sonnet, Gemini 2.5 Pro) 2. It introduces tool sprawl (numerous MCP clients, MCP servers to integrate)",
